The '''Overgrown Acre''' is an abandoned farm in [[Gilneas]] that is overrun by [[worgen]] of the [[Bloodclaw]] pack.

==NPCs==
* {{NPC|Combat|Bloodclaw Rager|icon=Worgen}}
* {{NPC|Combat|Bloodclaw Worgen|icon=Worgen}}
* {{NPC|Combat|Maltimor's Prototype|icon=LesserHarvestGolem}} (rare elite)

==Speculation==
Given the presence of [[Maltimor's Prototype]], which drops the [[Gartside Family Wrench]], this may have once been the home of [[Maltimor Gartside]].

